# Rewrites (status 200, no redirect) for the Cloudflare Worker that serves
# this directory. wrangler.jsonc sets html_handling to "none" so that
# /privacy.html and /terms.html — the URLs Google holds for OAuth
# verification — are served at exactly those paths; the price is that "none"
# also stops / from serving index.html, which the first line restores. The
# other two keep the extensionless paths GitHub Pages used to serve.
# tools/test-docs-worker.sh pins the behaviour; Cloudflare never serves this
# file itself.
/ /index.html 200
/privacy /privacy.html 200
/terms /terms.html 200
